00:06:55,944 --> 00:06:58,104
The cup and the caffeine simply keep

293
00:06:58,104 --> 00:06:59,304
very different hours.

294
00:06:59,304 --> 00:07:00,963
The mug was empty by four.

295
00:07:00,963 --> 00:07:02,483
The closed sign is still up at

296
00:07:02,483 --> 00:07:02,996
midnight.

297
00:07:02,996 --> 00:07:05,316
But here's the question we didn't answer:

298
00:07:05,316 --> 00:07:07,876
if caffeine only hides your tiredness,

299
00:07:07,876 --> 00:07:09,556
what happens when you drink it every

300
00:07:09,556 --> 00:07:10,436
single day?

301
00:07:10,436 --> 00:07:12,356
That's a mailbox for another day.

302
00:07:12,356 --> 00:07:13,076
Until then,

303
00:07:13,076 --> 00:07:14,516
tell us in the comments:

304
00:07:14,516 --> 00:07:16,758
what time is your last coffee?

305
00:07:18,667 --> 00:07:19,947
Thanks for watching.

306
00:07:19,947 --> 00:07:21,147
If you learned something,

307
00:07:21,147 --> 00:07:22,347
give it a like and share it

308
00:07:22,347 --> 00:07:23,147
with a friend.

309
00:07:23,147 --> 00:07:24,107
And subscribe,

310
00:07:24,107 --> 00:07:26,107
